issue:
table issue with ClearRows(), nils the data and does not reinitialize it

```
// this does not work...
table.ClearRows()

// data is now nil so this will not work.
table.Row("A","B","C") 
```


Here is a fix
```
// ClearRows clears the table rows.
func (t *Table) ClearRows() *Table {
	t.data = nil
	t.data = NewStringData()  /// <-- missing reinitialization.
	return t
}
```

